such a fan of this discovery of crufiture that I tested a version of Pimp's with orange, and it was validated!!! 
You squeeze a huge orange (150g of juice) 
You mix with 2 cases of chia 
You let it take 15 min  
You put in 6 silicone molds 
You freeze for 1 to 2 hours 
You melt 100g of chocolate in 20g of coconut oil (but you don't need all of it, it's just easier to dip the discs) 
You dip in it and store in the fridge or freezer (in this case take them out first so that the inside softens) 